                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Milton D. Miller II",
                        "email": "mdmii@outlook.com",
                        "username": "mdmillerii"
                    },
                    "message": "what is the address of the modbus device?\n\nthe unit address in the ADU in mbap?  The IP address of the gateway?\n\ndid you mean the server address?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Source/Modbus/FRU.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 14,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "In a daisy chained setup in RS-485 there can be up to 32 devices in segment which can go up with repeaters. This is referring to that as different type of devices can be daisy chained together."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Source/Modbus/FRU.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 18,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Milton D. Miller II",
                        "email": "mdmii@outlook.com",
                        "username": "mdmillerii"
                    },
                    "message": "how will these be probed?   By the port?  by some fru they are associated with?\n\nshould this be an association to the inventory for the port or the gateway?\n\nguess this should be discussed in the design documentation."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Source/Modbus/FRU.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 18,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, please refer to the design document https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/77318 ."
                }
